ddle corner story meadow silver island copper pocket timber field ladder circle falcon music yellow copper helmet cotton circle copper table feather candle silver violet meadow marble corner circle island marble saddle signal field bridge yellow gentle pocket gentle steady story cotton yellow copper shadow purple feather thunder anchor river field saddle paper winter story table bridge rocket engine ladder square harbor basket golden stone river narrow steady garden story feather falcon feather rapid bridge quiet window cabin winter violet meadow island orbit pocket river valley purple winter number island ribbon basket copper violet harbor cabin corner letter valley rapid gentle market quiet orbit engine letter market narrow meadow silver signal purple forest narrow ladder planet canvas story lantern music anchor silver narrow silver candle music yellow signal hollow bridge planet letter number river golden timber bridge garden rapid signal falcon anchor lantern anchor silver circle purple music harbor lantern mirror harbor silver maple quiet thunder orange pocket shadow candle winter field steady rocket helmet table anchor square violet simple falcon ladder steady signal meadow hollow cabin rapid gentle maple cabin rocket ribbon timber purple meadow orbit quiet letter golden music corner letter valley timber golden square stone market marble orbit forest copper engine island orbit signal violet helmet circle golden shadow market maple golden signal table hollow winter table orange valley basket lantern rocket hollow simple maple rapid stone planet silver lantern forest table thunder feather number yellow purple silver island rapid orbit number paper engine quiet pocket anchor bridge mirror river maple corner timber engine steady lantern copper number meadow mirror lantern orange purple island saddle violet letter winter timber garden hollow cotton quiet river basket letter mirror river garden lantern hollow market steady circle copper field window marble market garden rapid anchor pocket maple marble rapid thunder timber candle valley copper lantern river letter marble silver winter cotton ladder forest canvas saddle market maple table marble ribbon yellow winter rapid harbor meadow corner thunder garden square quiet steady feather river gentle story timber pocket square pocket marble narrow number cotton anchor shadow thunder pocket ribbon lantern island forest copper paper music harbor corner candle ribbon marble valley cabin engine letter canvas quiet rocket thunder basket corner silver helmet timber yellow bridge orange signal candle meadow timber field garden story hollow story feather saddle letter maple music golden letter yellow harbor paper river paper pocket feather cabin bridge forest ribbon helmet meadow valley window orbit marble yellow rocket quiet field table anchor anchor shadow number timber meadow table forest cabin saddle silver canvas candle orange planet quiet purple shadow letter yellow violet marble canvas rapid number market hollow corner harbor gentle garden marble marble\\n\\nWrite a story of about 3000 words that uses as many of the words above as you can.\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":8192,\"thinkingConfig\":{\"thinkingLevel\":\"low\"}}}"
